        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Newly Renovated 4 Bedroom Coastal Home"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ideally situated, Daffodil House presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turn-key Residence in a most convenient setting being a 5 minute walk to the Coastal Village of Ring and a 10 minute Drive to Clonakilty Town.\r\n\r\nThe Property has undergone a complete transformation in the last 2 years, with the original structure consisting of a 1970s Bungalow which has since been extended and extensively renovated.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property extends to approximately 1,250 Sq Ft and comprises of Entrance Hall, Kitchen/Living/Dining Room, Utility, Bathroom and 4 bedrooms with one being ensuite, with features including underfloor heating, new Kitchen Units with soft close presses, new appliances, new flooring, and insulation.\r\n\r\nThe Exterior of the property has also received extensive works with new windows & doors and external insulation having been installed to the original structure.\r\n\r\nThe Property enjoys ample parking with a newly tarred driveway to both the front and side of the property with a Patio area and lawn garden to the rear.\r\n\r\nViewings Highly Recommended\r\n\r\nClonakilty 10 Mins, Cork City 40 Mins\r\n\r\nServices: Mains Water, Private Drainage, Electricity & Air to Water heating\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
